U team, France, Germany, the UK and NATO attending. Russian strikes over the weekend left more than 850,000 Ukrainians without power.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/eu-to-send-joint-team-to-ukraine-russia-peace-talks-in-abu-dhabi","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n3"},{"cat":"Business","title":"U.S. futures rise after rough week; Nvidia falls about 4.5% premarket","summary":"Dow futures rose about 0.7% and S&P 500 futures 0.4% Monday after last week's post-midterm selloff, while Nvidia slid on the CEO probe. Markets fear a December Fed rate hike after strong October jobs data, with inflation figures due this week.","source":"Reuters via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/wall-st-futures-rise-rough-103539344.html","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n4"},{"cat":"World","title":"Krakow shooting suspect dies in hospital; six were killed in attack","summary":"The 24-year-old suspect in Poland's deadliest shooting since 1989 died early Monday. Six people were killed and 15 injured; police say he was drawn to far-right ideologies and also found three relatives dead in his flat.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/krakow-main-square-shooting-suspect-dies-in-hospital-police-say","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n5"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Trump plans to meet Putin and Xi at APEC summit in China","summary":"Trump said he expects a three-way meeting at the Nov. 18-19 APEC summit in Shenzhen, possibly covering denuclearization and ending the Iran war. A U.S.-China trade truce expires in January.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/donald-trump-plans-to-meet-vladimir-putin-and-xi-jinping-in-china-to-discuss-ending-iran-w","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"B.C. storm kills one as outages top 380,000; third storm due Monday","summary":"A driver died when a tree fell on two vehicles on Highway 10 in Surrey. BC Hydro reported about 135,000 customers out at the peak overnight Sunday and more than 380,000 outages since Friday.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141788/bc-storms-power-outages-strong-winds/","published":"2026-11-08","id":"n7"},{"cat":"World","title":"Israel's president taps Eisenkot to try to form a government","summary":"Gadi Eisenkot has 28 days, extendable by two weeks, to build a 61-seat majority after Netanyahu's bloc fell to 53 seats in the Oct. 27 election. If both leaders fail, Israel heads to new elections next spring.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141815/israel-government-whats-next-eisenkot-to-lead/","published":"2026-11-08","id":"n8"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Asian tech stocks rebound after post-midterm rout","summary":"Japan's Nikkei rose more than 3%, Taiwan's Taiex 5% and TSMC nearly 6% Monday. Markets price an 80% chance of a December Fed rate hike.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/tech-stocks-recover-after-midterms-rout-as-nvidia-takes-centre-stage","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n9"},{"cat":"AI","title":"U.S. AI safety centre left leaderless and drawn closer to White House","summary":"The Commerce Department's AI safety testing body has no permanent director, has stopped publishing research, and staff were asked to report informally to a White House office. Its budget is about $10 million a year.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/washingtons-ai-safety-watchdog-left-leaderless-as-it-is-drawn-closer-to-white-house","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Nearly 1,000 rally in Halifax for moratorium on AI data centres","summary":"Protests across Nova Scotia targeted a planned $10-billion data centre in Point Tupper leased to Anthropic, which would draw up to 420 megawatts by 2028. The province says it will proceed only if it meets guidelines.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141962/nova-scotia-data-centre-protest-moratorium/","published":"2026-11-08","id":"n11"},{"cat":"Major","title":"COP31 climate talks open in Antalya, Türkiye","summary":"The summit runs Nov. 9-20 with Australia steering negotiations. A key push is raising electricity's share of global energy use from about 20% to 35% by 2035.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/we-will-not-lower-our-ambition-everything-you-need-to-know-on-day-one-of-the-cop31-climate","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n12"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Anthropic reportedly buys $3.4B in gas generators for data centres","summary":"The FT reported Anthropic secured 1.7 gigawatts of gas-fired generators from Texas supplier OnePWR Solutions. The company expects to spend over $500 billion on AI infrastructure over 10 years.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/08/anthropic-generator-deal-ai-data-centers.html","published":"2026-11-08","id":"n13"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Europe's banks rally, tech sinks in week after U.S. midterms","summary":"The Stoxx 600 ended the week only 0.4% higher, as banks gained 3.2% and tech fell 3.6%. Rheinmetall dropped 19.1% after cutting its 2026 sales forecast.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/09/trumps-midterm-defeat-europes-biggest-stock-winners-and-losers","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n14"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Quebec minister 'deeply shocked' by 100 alleged immigration fraud cases","summary":"A former Immigration Ministry official is charged with breach of trust and forgery over more than 100 allegedly false Quebec selection certificates issued from 2016 to 2019. She is due in court Dec. 10.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141963/quebec-immigration-fraud-cases-minister-reaction/","published":"2026-11-08","id":"n15"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Two trains collide south of Cairo, killing seven and injuring 125","summary":"A Fayoum-bound train hit the rear of a stationary train near Al-Ayyat in Giza province on Sunday. President el-Sisi ordered an urgent investigation.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/09/egypt-seven-dead-125-injured-in-collision-between-two-trains","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n16"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Survey: nearly 1 in 5 U.S. workers replaced by AI were asked back","summary":"SHL found 19.1% of U.S. respondents replaced by AI were later rehired, often seeking raises and job guarantees. Employers have cited AI in 121,401 announced U.S. job cuts through October.","source":"Fortune","url":"https://fortune.com/2026/11/09/ai-rebounding-20-us-workers-replaced-higher-pay-job-security/","published":"2026-11-09","id":"n17"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Measles exposure warning for Toronto Pearson and Ajax ER","summary":"Durham Region reported a case in an unimmunized child who arrived Nov. 3 on Ethiopian Airlines flight ET552. People at Pearson Terminal 1 or the Ajax-Pickering ER that day should watch for symptoms until Nov. 24.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141827/measles-exposure-toronto-pearson-durham-region/","published":"2026-11-08","id":"n18"}]}